What this copy changes:
- Pretendard: the source ships TrueType files it converted itself from the official OTFs and keeps the name
  "Pretendard". Pretendard declares that name as a Reserved Font Name, so OFL does not allow a modified
  version to keep it. This copy ships the official TrueType files from the Pretendard v1.3.9 release
  (public/static/alternative/) instead. Their name tables, weight classes and glyph counts match the
  converted files, so the styles resolve the same fonts. scripts/convert_fonts.py now converts Noto Serif KR
  only, and assets/fonts/LICENSES.md and references/font-licenses.md carry the correction.
- Left out: README.md, README.en.md, AGENTS.md (repository-level docs) and examples/ (9 sample PDFs and
  35 preview PNGs, 24.4 MB). tests/mutations/fixture_from_example.py still takes any rendered PDF path.
- Everything else (SKILL.md, modes, references, scripts, styles, templates, tests, vendor bundle, other
  fonts) is unchanged.
